00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I found the mechanism rather peculiar.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The mechanism was concealed underneath.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
<i>John settled the dispute</i> {\an8}beside the river.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
[Music] JOHN: We shall settle this soon!

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The meticulous detective found it ambiguous.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
His perfunctory response tried to obfuscate the truth.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
They tried to coerce the witness in London, said Alice.
